step 26 "@pulse until 400 is DEAD"
pulses 94
out dec "\n\rThe sparring partner's punch grazes Heroic.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash hits the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash scratches the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash grazes the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner's punch misses Heroic.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash hits the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner's punch grazes Heroic.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash hits the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash hits the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash scratches the sparring partner.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rHeroic's slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner is DEAD!!\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Avenge me!'\n\rThe sparring partner hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9"
out hero "\n\rThe sparring partner's punch grazes you.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<27hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou block the sparring partner's attack with your shield.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash scratches the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<27hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou block the sparring partner's attack with your shield.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash grazes the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner has quite a few wounds. \n\r\n\r<27hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner's punch misses you.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<27hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe sparring partner's punch grazes you.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<25hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou block the sparring partner's attack with your shield.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<25hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou dodge the sparring partner's attack.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash scratches the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<25hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYou parry the sparring partner's attack.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Take that, Heroic!'\n\rThe sparring partner says 'I'm hurt, Heroic!'\n\rYour slash hits the sparring partner.\n\rThe sparring partner is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe sparring partner says 'Avenge me!'\n\rThe sparring partner hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\r\n\r<25hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9"
out god "\n\rYou hear something's death cry.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
